03E《食材探源 × 手作烹飪 × 營養科學》系列&nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E動手連結食物，發掘食物中的營養力量！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E活動頭炮：與菌同行\u003Cbr\u003E⭐️ 手作零酵母小圓餅：體驗徒手搓揉麵團的樂趣，感受食物的原始力量\u003Cbr\u003E⭐️ 探索「菌」世界：認識日常接觸的微生物，了解它們與健康的密切關聯。&nbsp;\u003Cbr\u003E⭐️ 健康全面升級：從增強身體好菌開始，提升腸道健康、免疫系統、情緒商數、認知功能，由內而外煥發健康光彩！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：9月20日（六）\u003Cbr\u003E時間：上午11:00至13:00\u003Cbr\u003E地點：油麻地登打士街家樂坊15樓廚藝教室\u003Cbr\u003E費用：$120\u002F位 &nbsp;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E小朋友也可以一起體驗徒手揉搓麵團🥳歡迎垂詢\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","2025-09-20","《食材探源 × 手作烹飪 × 營養科學》系列 ","food-good-bacteria",null,"2025-09-14T07:35:34.424Z",{"data":11},[12],{"id":13,"attributes":14},6,{"name":15,"slug":16,"description":8,"createdAt":17,"updatedAt":17},"活學營養","nutrition","2023-02-12T02:38:55.947Z",{"data":19},{"id":20,"attributes":21},74,{"name":22,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":23,"height":24,"formats":25,"hash":56,"ext":27,"mime":30,"size":57,"url":58,"previewUrl":8,"provider":59,"provider_metadata":8,"createdAt":60,"updatedAt":60},"1.jpeg",1080,1350,{"large":26,"small":35,"medium":42,"thumbnail":49},{"ext":27,"url":28,"hash":29,"mime":30,"name":31,"path":8,"size":32,"width":33,"height":34},".jpeg","https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_1_ef796d8456.jpeg","large_1_ef796d8456","image\u002Fjpeg","large_1.jpeg",141.76,800,1000,{"ext":27,"url":36,"hash":37,"mime":30,"name":38,"path":8,"size":39,"width":40,"height":41},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_1_ef796d8456.jpeg","small_1_ef796d8456","small_1.jpeg",50.37,400,500,{"ext":27,"url":43,"hash":44,"mime":30,"name":45,"path":8,"size":46,"width":47,"height":48},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_1_ef796d8456.jpeg","medium_1_ef796d8456","medium_1.jpeg",92.94,600,750,{"ext":27,"url":50,"hash":51,"mime":30,"name":52,"path":8,"size":53,"width":54,"height":55},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fthumbnail_1_ef796d8456.jpeg","thumbnail_1_ef796d8456